# Simplified Chinese (zh-CN) catalog for the buffer search bar, the project
# search view and the text finder.
#
# Glob patterns, regexes and file names in the placeholder examples are
# deliberately left untranslated.

## 搜索栏输入框

search-placeholder = 搜索…
replace-with = 替换为…
search-all-files-placeholder = 搜索所有文件…
replace-in-project = 在项目中替换…
include-e-g-src-rs = 包含：例如 src/**/*.rs
exclude-e-g-vendor-lock = 排除：例如 vendor/*, *.lock
find-in-results = 在结果中查找

## 搜索选项

match-whole-words = 全字匹配
match-case-sensitivity = 区分大小写
use-regular-expressions = 使用正则表达式
also-search-files-ignored-by-configuration = 同时搜索被配置忽略的文件
one-match-per-line = 每行一个匹配项
search-backwards = 向后搜索

## 搜索栏按钮

toggle-replace = 切换替换
toggle-filters = 切换筛选器
toggle-search-selection = 切换在选区中搜索
select-all-matches = 选择所有匹配项
replace-next-match = 替换下一个匹配项
replace-all-matches = 替换所有匹配项
close-search-bar = 关闭搜索栏
only-search-open-files = 仅搜索已打开的文件
no-more-matches = 没有更多匹配项
search-limits-reached-try-narrowing-your-search =
    已达到搜索结果上限
    请尝试缩小搜索范围

## 项目搜索视图

project-search = 项目搜索
search-all-files = 搜索所有文件
loading-project = 正在加载项目…
searching = 正在搜索…
no-results-found-in-this-project-for-the-provided-query = 在此项目中未找到与该查询匹配的结果
project-search-buffer-contains-unsaved-edits-do-you-want-to-save-it = 项目搜索缓冲区中有未保存的修改，是否保存？

## 项目搜索起始页提示

hit-enter-to-search-for-more-options = 按回车开始搜索。更多选项：
include-exclude-specific-paths = 包含/排除特定路径
find-and-replace = 查找与替换
match-with-regex = 使用正则匹配
match-case = 区分大小写
landing-match-whole-words = 全字匹配

## 文本查找器操作菜单

split-menu-header = 拆分…
up = 上侧
down = 下侧
open-selected-file = 打开文件
open-multiple = 打开多个
open-as-tab = 作为标签页打开
fold = 折叠
unfold = 展开
